@fact seraphine.seer
# en: A seer who speaks in half-sentences and is unsettlingly often right.
text [8fee9c] = 一个说话总说半句的先知，准得叫人心里发毛。

@fact seraphine.slips
# en: Sometimes she slips a day ahead and needs someone to tell her what today is.
text [6bdae8] = 有时她会滑到明天去，需要有人告诉她今天是哪一天。
# en: Sometimes she isn't quite in today.
hint [113880] = 有时候，她不太在“今天”里。

@fact seraphine.oracle
# en: Her mother is the Oracle of Vell, who wants her home to tell kings what they want to hear.
text [e701e0] = 她的母亲是维尔神谕，想让她回家，去对国王们说他们爱听的话。
# en: Get close, and ask about home.
hint [51f62b] = 跟她熟起来，问问她的家。

@fact seraphine.self
# en: Seers can't see themselves, unless someone is standing next to them.
text [90e477] = 先知看不见自己——除非有人站在他们身边。
# en: Stand next to her while she paints.
hint [46c550] = 她画画时，站在她身边。

@fact seraphine.lake
# en: The lake calls to her at night. She says it calls to you too.
text [37ecd3] = 夜里，湖在呼唤她。她说，它也在呼唤你。
# en: Ask what she hears at night.
hint [6ba648] = 问问她夜里听见了什么。

@fact seraphine.too_loud
# en: When everyone's futures get too loud she hides in the dark. Yours, she says, is quiet.
text [9cdeb7] = 当所有人的未来吵得太响时，她会躲进黑暗里。她说，你的未来很安静。
# en: Find out where she hides.
hint [a3ca00] = 弄清楚她躲在哪里。

@fact seraphine.paintings
# en: What she sees ahead comes out in her paintings, sometimes months early. She hides the ones she didn't mean to paint under her bed.
text [18b183] = 她预见的东西会出现在她的画里，有时早上好几个月。她不是有意画出的那些，都藏在床底下。
# en: Look under her bed. Or ask.
hint [34b5b0] = 看看她床底下。或者直接问。
